          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3>The Allergen Reality</h3><p>Food allergies are not a lifestyle preference. In the UK alone, research shows that over <strong>2 million adults*</strong> live with confirmed food allergies.</p><p>Yet in both retail aisles and commercial hospitality kitchens, allergen-safe alternatives are routinely treated as compromised compromises: packed with unpronounceable chemical binders, devoid of authentic flavour, or confined to a tiny 'free-from' quarantine shelf.</p><p>We formulate every single recipe <strong>completely free from all 14 major regulated allergens</strong> from day one. No peanuts, tree nuts, gluten, dairy, eggs, soy, sesame, mustard, celery, lupin, fish, crustaceans, molluscs, or sulphites. One sauce, universally safe.</p><p></p><p>*<em>Source: Food Standards Agency (2020, 2024).</em></p>",
            "margin_top": 2
          }
