        "text_block": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3>The Ultra-Processed Trap</h3><p>When mass-market manufacturers remove gluten, eggs, or dairy, they typically substitute them with ultra-processed fillers: modified starches, maltodextrins, xanthan gum, synthetic emulsifiers, and artificial preservatives.</p><p>Today, over <strong>51% of daily calorie intake in the UK*</strong> comes from ultra-processed food (UPF). The evidence linking it to poorer health is real, though causation isn’t proven — we formulate with recognisable, natural ingredients only.</p><p>Our sauces contain real vine tomatoes, whole cider vinegar, raw honey, fermented chillies, garlic, ginger, and freshly ground spices. No industrial texturisers. No chemical stabilizers. Real food, period.</p><p>* <em>Source: SACN, (2023).</em></p>",
            "margin_top": 2
          }
        }
